RESEARCH SOFTWARE -- NO WARRANTY

This is research software. Its output is a hypothesis, not a measurement.

Sensor coefficients are digitized from published graphs or synthesized by
analogy, NOT measured on Scentience hardware. The plume model is validated
against published turbulence statistics, not against a wind tunnel. The
Isaac Sim / Isaac Lab integration is unvalidated.

Nothing here is calibrated, qualified, or certified for safety, medical,
environmental-compliance, or life-critical use. Do not use simulator output
